  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\begin{aligned} & f^{\\prime}(x)=3 x^2 \\sin \\left(\\frac{1}{x}\\right)-x \\cos \\left(\\frac{1}{x}\\right) \\\\ & f^{\\prime \\prime}(x)=6 x \\sin \\left(\\frac{1}{x}\\right)-3 \\cos \\left(\\frac{1}{x}\\right)-\\cos \\left(\\frac{1}{x}\\right)-\\frac{\\sin \\left(\\frac{1}{x}\\right)}{x} \\\\ & f^{\\prime \\prime}\\left(\\frac{2}{\\pi}\\right)=\\frac{12}{\\pi}-\\frac{\\pi}{2}=\\frac{24-\\pi^2}{2 \\pi}\\end{aligned}$"
